      <div class="section">
        <h2>Content provided "as is"</h2>
        <p>Information published on this site (dates, venues, ticket links) is provided for informational purposes <strong>without any guarantee of accuracy or completeness</strong>. Event dates and details may change without notice.</p>
        <p>countdowns.co cannot be held liable for errors, omissions, or changes made after publication, or for any loss resulting from the use of this information.</p>
        <p>Use of this site is at the user's own risk.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Applicable law</h2>
        <p>These legal notices are governed by French law. In the event of a dispute, French courts shall have sole jurisdiction.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- KR -->
    <div class="t-kr">

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Mention légal</h2>
        <p>Konfòmeman épi lwa fransèz n° 2004-575 di 21 jen 2004, enfomasyon sa yo bay itilizatè sit <strong>caribbean-countdowns.co</strong>.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Éditè</h2>
        <p>
          Responsab piblikasyon : M. DELEPINE<br />
          Sit web : <a href="https://caribbean-countdowns.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">caribbean-countdowns.co</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Ébergman</h2>
        <p>
          Sit la ébergé pa <strong>GitHub Pages</strong>, sèvis GitHub, Inc.<br />
          88 Colin P Kelly Jr Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, Etazini<br />
          <a href="https://pages.github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pages.github.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Kuki épi done pèsonèl</h2>
        <span class="badge">Okenn kuki</span>
        <p>Sit la <strong>pa itilizé okenn kuki</strong>.</p>
        <p><strong>Préférans lokal</strong> — Lang ou chwazi (FR, EN, KR, ES) épi pwogresyon kiz la enregistré adan navigatè ou pa <code>localStorage</code>. Done sa yo rèsté sou aparèy ou épi pa janmen transmèt bay on sèvè.</p>
        <p><strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> — Sit la itilizé Cloudflare Web Analytics pou mezuré trafik san kuki. Done kolèkté : paj vizité, peyi, tip aparèy, sous trafik. Okenn done pèsonèl idantifiab pa kolèkté, okenn swivi kwa-sit. <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#34d399;">Politik konfidansyalité Cloudflare ↗</a></p>
        <p><strong>Konptè vizit</strong> — On konptè anonim afichè pa sèvis tièrs <strong>visitor-badge.laobi.icu</strong>. Sèvis sa a pa déposé kuki épi pa kolèkté okenn done pèsonèl idantifiab.</p>
        <p><strong>Estatistik évènman</strong> — Nonb vit pa évènman enregistré de fason agréjé adan Cloudflare KV. Okenn swivi pèsonèl, okenn adrès IP enregistré.</p>
        <p><strong>Fòmilè sijestyon</strong> — Done ou rantre adan fòmilè sijestyon évènman an trete côté kliyan sèlman épi voye pa kliyan imèl ou. Okenn estokaj côté sèvè.</p>
        <p>Pou nenpòt demann konsènan done ou : <strong>contact@countdowns.co</strong></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="section">
